flowchart TD
    A["_refine_batch(H)"] --> B["_h_moved(H): relative Frobenius change<br/>rel = ‖H − H_cache‖_F / ‖H_cache‖_F<br/><b>IN-BAND BINS ONLY</b> — 901 of 2049 here"]
    B --> C{"rel &gt; frf_update_threshold?<br/>default 0.5"}
    C -->|"NO — ~95% of calls<br/>nothing is meaningfully<br/>re-estimating H"| D["<b>FAST PATH</b> · latched for the whole call"]
    C -->|"YES — a genuine excursion"| R["<b>SAFE PATH</b> · every bin this call<br/>falls back to the base-class SDP"]
    D --> E["_restricted_basis(H)<br/>thin SVD H = U Σ Vᴴ<br/>keep k directions with σ ≥ rc·σ₁"]
    E --> F["_effective_drive_rcond<br/>rc = drive_rcond × plant spread<br/>spread = smallest STRUCTURAL direction,<br/>found by the largest gap in the σ spectrum<br/>(σ₅/σ₁ = 0.0152 here, ×2.0 → 0.030)"]
    F --> G["Burer-Monteiro in the restricted basis<br/>X_k = L Lᴴ,  L is k × r,  r = min(bm_rank, k)<br/>PSD by construction — no cone constraint"]
    G --> H["L-BFGS-B, analytic Wirtinger gradient<br/>min ‖diag(H X Hᴴ) − y‖² + reg‖X‖²_F<br/>maxiter 50, ftol 1e-9, gtol 1e-7"]
    H --> I["map back: X = V_k X_k V_kᴴ<br/>PSD preserved by congruence"]
    R --> S["coherence-capped SDP, CLARABEL<br/>+ IRLS if error_domain = db"]
    I --> Z["return X for this bin"]
    S --> Z
    W1["<b>WHY the gate exists</b><br/>The unconstrained factored solve can drive<br/>pairwise drive coherence toward 1, which makes<br/>a live H1 estimator's reference CPSD singular.<br/>Safe only while nothing re-estimates H."] -.-> C
    W2["<b>WHY the restriction exists</b><br/>Unrestricted, the solve buys accuracy with drive<br/>down near-null directions. The answer is not wrong,<br/>it is UNREALIZABLE: run 22 predicted −0.39 dB and<br/>measured +14.29 dB at 17.8 V. A 1% drive<br/>perturbation predicts +16.69 dB."] -.-> F
    W3["<b>WHY in-band only</b><br/>1148 out-of-band bins carry no drive energy,<br/>so the live estimate there is noise. Measured over<br/>the whole array the metric read median 4.37 against<br/>the base class's 0.17 on the same data — a factor<br/>of 25 — and runs 21 and 28 demoted on 99% of calls."] -.-> B
